## markdown
# Folded content

<details><summary>Outer &amp; more</summary>

Outer text.

<details open><summary>Inner</summary>

- inner item

</details>

After inner.

</details>

<details><summary>One block</summary>

No blank lines inside.

</details>

<details><summary>Details</summary>

No summary.

</details>

```html
<details><summary>Never closed</summary>
```

Stays as it is.

## html
<h1 id="folded-content">Folded content</h1>
<details>
<summary>Outer &amp; more</summary>
<div class="details-content">
<p>Outer text.</p>
<details open>
<summary>Inner</summary>
<div class="details-content">
<ul>
<li>
<p>inner item</p>
</li>
</ul>
</div>
</details>
<p>After inner.</p>
</div>
</details>
<details>
<summary>One block</summary>
<div class="details-content">
<p>No blank lines inside.</p>
</div>
</details>
<details>
<summary>Details</summary>
<div class="details-content">
<p>No summary.</p>
</div>
</details>
<pre>
<code class="language-html">&lt;details&gt;&lt;summary&gt;Never closed&lt;/summary&gt;</code>
</pre>
<p>Stays as it is.</p>
